```markdown
## Description
Brief summary of changes and rationale.

## Type of Change
- [ ] Feature
- [ ] Bug fix
- [ ] Breaking change
- [ ] Documentation

## Changes
- Bullet list of concrete changes
- What was added/modified/removed

## Testing
- How to test locally

